          <p>Every menu control is a native button, select or slider, reachable with <kbd>Tab</kbd> and operable with <kbd>Enter</kbd>/<kbd>Space</kbd>. Mission text, cash changes and notifications are announced through polite live regions.</p>
          <p>The wanted level is shown by star count and by the ring beside it, not by colour alone. Pursuit strobes switch to a steady state when reduced motion is on.</p>
          <form id="a11y-form" onsubmit="return false">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="set-reduce-motion"> Reduce motion (no title animation, no camera shake, no strobing)</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="set-contrast"> High-contrast HUD</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="set-large-hud"> Larger HUD text</label>
          </form>
        </div>
